{"seq":23,"slug":"mobile-deep-linking","title":"移动端深链","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"移动端深链-mobile-deep-linking\">移动端深链（Mobile Deep Linking）</h1><p>移动端深链是将用户从外部入口（广告、邮件、短信、网页、二维码）精准导航到 App 内特定页面的核心技术。与普通 Web URL 不同，深链必须跨越&quot;App 是否已安装&quot;这道门槛，并在 iOS 和 Android 两个平台的安全模型、沙盒机制之间找到可行路径。本 hub 从协议层到工程实现，系统覆盖深链技术栈的每个环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的核心问题\">本 Hub 的核心问题</h2><p>一条深链从外部被点击，到用户看到 App 内目标页面，中间经历了什么？当 App 未安装时如何保留意图？如何在隐私约束越来越强的生态里做归因？iOS 和 Android 的原生实现有哪些关键差异？这些问题构成了本 hub 的主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 — 深链基础</strong></td>\n<td>URI Scheme / Universal Links / App Links 的协议机制与对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2 — 延迟深链与归因</strong></td>\n<td>延迟深链流程、设备指纹技术、剪贴板检测与隐私合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>3 — 平台实现</strong></td>\n<td>iOS（SwiftUI / UIKit / SceneDelegate）与 Android（Jetpack / Compose）原生实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 — 工程实践</strong></td>\n<td>Web-to-App 路由、深链测试体系、分析归因、链接迁移管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与邻近-hub-的边界\">与邻近 Hub 的边界</h2><p>本 hub 专注于深链技术协议、平台 API 调用和工程运维，不涉及以下领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>React Native 深链</strong> — React Native 层的 Linking API 和导航库集成见 <code>04_mobile/20_react-native-development</code></li>\n<li><strong>跨平台深链</strong> — Flutter / KMP 的路由抽象层见 <code>04_mobile/07_cross-platform-development</code></li>\n<li><strong>移动端 CI/CD 发布</strong> — 深链配置的自动化部署与测试流水线见 <code>04_mobile/09_mobile-cicd-release</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 的内容以平台原生 API（Swift / Kotlin / Java）为基准，涵盖 AASA、Digital Asset Links 等系统级协议配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阅读路径建议\">阅读路径建议</h2><p><strong>入门路径</strong>：深链类型与协议 → Universal Links 与 App Links → iOS 深链实现 → Android 深链实现</p>\n<p><strong>归因追踪路径</strong>：延迟深链流程 → 指纹归因技术 → 分析与归因</p>\n<p><strong>工程运维路径</strong>：Web-to-App 路由 → 深链测试 → 迁移与版本管理</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"深链基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-link-types-protocols","title":"深链类型与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/deep-link-types-protocols"},{"seq":2,"slug":"universal-links-app-links","title":"Universal Links 与 App Links","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/universal-links-app-links"},{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-uri-scheme","title":"自定义 URI Scheme","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/custom-uri-scheme"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"deferred","title":"延迟深链与归因","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deferred-deep-link-flow","title":"延迟深链流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/deferred-deep-link-flow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fingerprint-attribution","title":"指纹归因技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/fingerprint-attribution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clipboard-paste-detection","title":"剪贴板与粘贴检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/clipboard-paste-detection"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"平台实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ios-deep-linking-implementation","title":"iOS 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/ios-deep-linking-implementation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"android-deep-linking-implementation","title":"Android 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/android-deep-linking-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"web-to-app-routing","title":"Web-to-App 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/web-to-app-routing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deep-link-testing","title":"深链测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/deep-link-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"analytics-attribution","title":"分析与归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/analytics-attribution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"link-migration-versioning","title":"迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/engineering/link-migration-versioning"}]}]}